{
  "id": "m00l2",
  "title": {
    "es": "Mostrar varias cosas",
    "en": "Showing several things"
  },
  "theory": {
    "es": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "value": "print por dentro"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "`print` puede mostrar varias cosas separadas por **comas** (las une con un espacio), y también números, que van **sin comillas**:"
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "value": [
          "print('Tengo', 3, 'gatos')"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "output",
        "value": [
          "Tengo 3 gatos"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "Cada `print` empieza en una **línea nueva**. Así, con varios `print`, muestras un mensaje en varias líneas."
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "value": [
          "print('Hola')",
          "print('Adiós')"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "output",
        "value": [
          "Hola",
          "Adiós"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "note",
        "value": "Las comillas marcan el texto; los números van sin comillas."
      }
    ],
    "en": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "value": "Inside print"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "`print` can show several things separated by **commas** (joined with a space), and also numbers, which go **without quotes**:"
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "value": [
          "print('Tengo', 3, 'gatos')"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "output",
        "value": [
          "Tengo 3 gatos"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "Each `print` starts on a **new line**. So with several `print`s you show a message across multiple lines."
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "value": [
          "print('Hola')",
          "print('Adiós')"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "output",
        "value": [
          "Hola",
          "Adiós"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "note",
        "value": "Quotes mark text; numbers go without quotes."
      }
    ]
  },
  "exercises": [
    {
      "id": "m00l2e1",
      "prompt": {
        "es": "Muestra exactamente: Tengo 3 gatos",
        "en": "Print exactly: Tengo 3 gatos"
      },
      "starter_code": [
        "# escribe aquí tu código"
      ],
      "solution": [
        "print('Tengo', 3, 'gatos')"
      ],
      "hints": {
        "es": [
          "Puedes usar print('Tengo', 3, 'gatos') con comas."
        ],
        "en": [
          "You can use print('Tengo', 3, 'gatos') with commas."
        ]
      },
      "tests": [
        {
          "type": "stdout",
          "expected": "Tengo 3 gatos"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "m00l2e2",
      "prompt": {
        "es": "Muestra dos líneas: primero Hola y luego Adiós",
        "en": "Print two lines: first Hola then Adiós"
      },
      "starter_code": [
        "# escribe aquí tu código"
      ],
      "solution": [
        "print('Hola')",
        "print('Adiós')"
      ],
      "hints": {
        "es": [
          "Usa dos print, uno por línea."
        ],
        "en": [
          "Use two print statements, one per line."
        ]
      },
      "tests": [
        {
          "type": "stdout",
          "expected": [
            "Hola",
            "Adiós"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}